        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{25}{86}$",
          "worked": "Total number of lollies $=250+170+300+140=860$.\n\nThere are 250 chocolates manufactured by the Yummy Sweet Company.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{Yummy chocolate})&=\\frac{250}{860}\\\\P(\\text{Yummy chocolate})&=\\frac{25}{86}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
